msgstr "ADF"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:11
#, kde-format
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanzao"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:12
#, kde-format
msgid "Compression"
msgstr "Compresión"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:13
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Selects the scanner compression method for faster scans, possibly at the "
"expense of image quality."
msgstr ""
"Esbilla'l métodu de compresión del escáner, quiciabes a espenses de la "
"calidá d'imaxe"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:15
#, kde-format
msgid "JPEG compression factor"
msgstr "Fautor de compresión JPEG"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Sets the scanner JPEG compression factor. Larger numbers mean better "
"compression, and smaller numbers mean better image quality."
msgstr ""
"Afita'l fautor de compresión JPEG del escáner. Númberos más llargos "
"signifiquen menos compresión, pero más pequeños quieren dicir meyor calidá "
"d'imaxe"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:19
#, kde-format
msgid "Batch scan"
msgstr "Escanéu per llotes"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:20
#, kde-format
msgid "Enables continuous scanning with automatic document feeder (ADF)."
msgstr ""
"Habilita l'escanéu continuu col alimentador de documentos automáticu (ADF)."

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:21
#, kde-format
msgid "Duplex"
msgstr "Doblu"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:22
#, kde-format
msgid "Enables scanning on both sides of the page."
msgstr "Habilita l'escanéu en dambes cares de la páxina."

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:23
#, kde-format
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "Xeometría"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:24
#, kde-format
msgid "Length measurement"
msgstr "Midimientu de llargor"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:25
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Selects how the scanned image length is measured and reported, which is "
"impossible to know in advance for scrollfed scans."
msgstr ""
"Esbilla como se mide ya informa del llargor de la imaxe escaniada que ye "
"imposible de saber de mou antemáu pa escaneos per desplazamientu."

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:27
#, kde-format
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Desconocíu"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:28
#, kde-format
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Illimitáu"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:29
#, kde-format
msgid "Approximate"
msgstr "Aproximada"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:30
#, kde-format
msgid "Padded"
msgstr "Rellenu"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:31
#, kde-format
msgid "Exact"
msgstr "Exauta"

#: i18n-hplip.cpp:32
#, kde-format
msgid "???"
msgstr "¿?¿?"

#: ksanedevicedialog.cpp:64
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html>The SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy) system could not find any device."
"<br>Check that the scanner is plugged in and turned on<br>or check your "
"systems scanner setup.<br>For details about SANE see the <a href='http://www."
"sane-project.org/'>SANE homepage</a>.</html>"
msgstr ""
"<html>El sistema SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy) nun pudo alcontrar dal "
"preséu.<br>Comprueba que l'escáner tea enchufáu y prendíu<br> o comprueba la "
"configuración del escáner del to ordenador.<br>Pa detalles tocante a SANE "
"mira la <a href='http://www.sane-project.org/'>páxina d'aniciu de SANE</a>.</"
"html>"

